# Research agent action grammar  (YOU: write the rules below)
#
# Goal (ClaimScan plan): every agent turn must be exactly one of
#     search("<query>")
#     stop
# so the LangGraph inner loop can parse the action without retries.
#
# Spec to implement:
#   - root is one action, nothing before or after it (no prose, no thinking text)
#   - query: 1..200 printable chars, no double quote or newline inside
#   - optional: allow `stop` to carry a short reason later, e.g. stop("enough evidence")
#
# References: /mnt/e/llm/llama.cpp/grammars/README.md (syntax), json.gbnf / list.gbnf (examples)
# Test: llama-cli -m <agent.gguf> --grammar-file llamacpp/grammars/research_action.gbnf -p "..."

root ::= "TODO"
